# Random faults on the Stopwatch (P8d): how one is vetted, and what its Brief asks.
# STOP and RESET (0.00), START, counting, then STOP: 0.00, 0.2, 0.5, 0.70.
machine stopwatch
task "Try START, STOP and RESET."
press SW2:50ms:100ms
press SW3:150ms:250ms
press SW1:300ms:400ms
press SW2:1000ms:1100ms
capture 280ms
capture 600ms
capture 900ms
capture 1300ms
